
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title><%= title %> | ParcelTrack</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/public.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/responsive.css">

    <style>
        .about-page {
            background: #f8f8f8;
            padding: 65px 20px 80px;
        }

        .about-container {
            max-width: 1050px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .about-hero {
            text-align: center;
            max-width: 760px;
            margin: 0 auto 55px;
        }

        .about-label {
            display: inline-block;
            color: #ff6e49;
            background: #fff0eb;
            padding: 8px 15px;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .about-hero h1 {
            font-size: 38px;
            line-height: 1.25;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            color: #171717;
        }

        .about-hero p {
            color: #777;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .about-section {
            background: #fff;
            padding: 35px;
            border: 1px solid #eee;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .about-section h2 {
            font-size: 23px;
            color: #171717;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .about-section p {
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.8;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .about-features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            gap: 18px;
            margin-top: 25px;
        }

        .about-feature {
            padding: 23px;
            background: #fafafa;
            border: 1px solid #eee;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .about-feature-icon {
            width: 42px;
            height: 42px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: #fff0eb;
            color: #ff6e49;
            border-radius: 9px;
            font-size: 19px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .about-feature h3 {
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 9px;
            color: #171717;
        }

        .about-feature p {
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .about-cta {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 25px;
            background: #171717;
            border-radius: 12px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .about-cta h2 {
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 25px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .about-cta p {
            color: #ccc;
            margin-bottom: 23px;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .about-cta a {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 13px 23px;
            background: #ff6e49;
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .about-cta a:hover {
            background: #e85d3b;
        }

        @media (max-width: 650px) {
            .about-page {
                padding: 40px 15px 55px;
            }

            .about-hero h1 {
                font-size: 29px;
            }

            .about-section {
                padding: 24px 20px;
            }

            .about-features {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .about-cta h2 {
                font-size: 21px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <%- include('partials/public-header', { activePage: 'about' }) %>

    <main class="about-page">

        <div class="about-container">

            <section class="about-hero">
                <span class="about-label">ABOUT PARCELTRACK</span>

                <h1>Making Parcel Delivery Easier to Track</h1>

                <p>
                    ParcelTrack is a parcel dispatch and tracking system
                    designed to simplify parcel management and provide
                    customers with clear shipment progress updates.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="about-section">
                <h2>Who We Are</h2>

                <p>
                    ParcelTrack provides a centralized platform for managing
                    parcel registrations, delivery assignments, and shipment
                    status updates. It helps administrative staff organize
                    deliveries while allowing delivery staff to manage their
                    assigned parcels.
                </p>

                <p style="margin-top: 12px;">
                    Customers can also track their parcels using a unique
                    tracking number without needing to create an account.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="about-section">
                <h2>What We Offer</h2>

                <p>
                    Our system brings the essential parcel management
                    activities together in one place.
                </p>

                <div class="about-features">

                    <div class="about-feature">
                        <div class="about-feature-icon">01</div>
                        <h3>Parcel Tracking</h3>
                        <p>
                            Check the current status of a shipment and
                            view its recorded delivery history.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="about-feature">
                        <div class="about-feature-icon">02</div>
                        <h3>Shipment Management</h3>
                        <p>
                            Register parcels, calculate delivery charges,
                            and manage shipment information.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="about-feature">
                        <div class="about-feature-icon">03</div>
                        <h3>Delivery Assignment</h3>
                        <p>
                            Administrators can assign registered parcels
                            to available delivery staff.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="about-feature">
                        <div class="about-feature-icon">04</div>
                        <h3>Delivery Updates</h3>
                        <p>
                            Delivery staff can update parcel statuses,
                            while shipment history keeps a record of changes.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </section>

            <section class="about-section">
                <h2>How It Works</h2>

                <p>
                    The process begins when an administrator registers a
                    parcel and generates its tracking number. The parcel
                    is then assigned to delivery staff, who update its
                    progress as it moves through the delivery process.
                    Customers can use the tracking number to view the
                    latest recorded shipment status and history.
                </p>
            </section>

            <section class="about-cta">
                <h2>Have a Parcel to Track?</h2>

                <p>
                    Enter your tracking number to check your shipment's
                    latest status.
                </p>

                <a href="/track">Track Your Parcel</a>
            </section>

        </div>

    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>

</body>
</html>
